A spec key nobody declares — here `rooot` for `root` — fails the spec instead of being dropped
silently, so the typo surfaces named rather than running the query with the key ignored.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/config.yaml --
core:
  probe_playbook:
    queries:
      plans:
        glob:
          - plans/*/index.md
        rooot: core
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plans/alpha/index.md --
---
title: Alpha
---

body
-- cmd --
booping query --config core.probe_playbook.queries.plans
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: invalid query spec from config path core.probe_playbook.queries.plans: 1 validation error for QuerySpec
rooot
  Extra inputs are not permitted [type=extra_forbidden, input_value='core', input_type=str]
[..]
